  "title": "Coast Guard medevacs U.S. passenger from MS Rotterdam cruise ship near Cabo Rojo, Puerto Rico",
  "description": "The aircrew of a Coast Guard Air Station Borinquen MH-60T Jayhawk helicopter hoists a 78-year-old man, U.S. citizen, from the MS Rotterdam cruise ship during a medical evacuation Nov. 13, 2022, approximately nine nautical miles southwest of Cabo Rojo, Puerto Rico. Local Emergency Medical Service personnel received and transported the patient to a hospital in San Juan, Puerto Rico.  (U.S. Coast Guard video)",
